# Compiled binaries built alongside the live one. `claude` above matches ONLY the
# exact name, so every parked//backup build was untracked-but-not-ignored and showed
# up as a `??` staging candidate — 601 MB of them as of 2026-09-03. Listed
# explicitly rather than as `claude-*`, which would also swallow claude-renamer.md.
claude-2.1.*
claude-test
claude-prev-*
claude-rel
claude-rel-*
*.backup

